      "text": "1  IN THE SUPREME COURT OF INDIA  CIVIL APPELLATE JURISDICTION  CIVIL APPEAL NO.2385 OF 2025  THE STATE OF HIMACHAL PRADESH APPELLANT  VERSUS  KIRPA RAM RESPONDEN  O R D E R",
